{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026RxbXT8YOoJ1794815257.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>亞太區股市普遍向下。</p><p></p><p>日本股市先升後回，指數早段曾升穿61,000點。日本第三季度國內生產總值，差過市場預期，按年收縮百分之0.1，日本股市失守六萬點關口，收市跌逾1,400點。</p><p></p><p>韓國股市連跌第三個交易日，一度跌逾百分之4，收市跌幅略為收窄。</p><p></p><p>台灣股市在晶片股拖累，收市跌逾2,600點，以點數計，跌幅是歷來第二大，台積電跌逾半成，鴻海跌逾百分之9。</p><p></p><p>澳洲股市收市偏軟。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T08:55:28.774247+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":185,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T07:36:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T03:20:44.274445+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T08:48:41.916840+00:00","content_hash":"bb4f14b263dd90e52f2de60a9a02daa3adde20fd1d16134516ee8656379f8256","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-16T08:55:28.774247+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}